        ],
        "title": "YoutubeAddRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "YoutubeSoundRead": {
        "description": "`POST /api/sounds/youtube`'s response: a `SoundRead` plus the add-time\nembeddability warning (ADR-0005). Non-null only when the oEmbed heuristic\nreturned a 401 (\"owner may have disabled embedding\") \u2014 the sound is still\ncreated, but the client can use this to show an \"Add anyway\"-style notice.",
